# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANONYMITY GUARD
#
# This repository is published to the public internet by GitHub Pages.
# Anything committed here is downloadable by anyone, forever, and is
# indexed by search engines.
#
# The Panel roster spreadsheet holds personal e-mail addresses, personal
# phone numbers, sobriety dates and home groups. It must NEVER be committed.
# Keep it in the Area's private Google Drive.
#
# data/trusted-servants.csv is the public, redacted view of that roster:
# first name + last initial, role-based service addresses only.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# the panel workbook — personal e-mail, phone, sobriety date, home group
*Teammates*.xlsx
*Teammates*.xls
*Teammates*.csv

# any other contact roster. NOTE: this also catches archived rosters pulled off
# the old sites. If one is caught, it is because it is a contact list — decide
# what to do with it in data/archive-review.csv rather than force-adding it.
*roster*.xls*
*Roster*.xls*
*confidential*
*Confidential*
*CONFIDENTIAL*

